  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You have great skill at wielding positive energy.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Channel Force<sup>ARG</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> When using this feat, add a +2 bonus on combat maneuver checks made to push or pull the target on a failed save. If you expend one use of mythic power, you increase the distance you can push or pull the target to 5 feet per 1d6 points of your channel energy ability on a failed save, and the target is knocked prone at the end of that movement. If the target succeeds on its save against your channeled energy, you can still attempt to push or pull the target 5 feet.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-general-a-f-feats#toc56\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
